                {"en": "Distinguish between three-dimensional passage through and two-dimensional crossing across.", "cn": "清清楚楚、严格区分从物体内部立体穿过的 through，与从物体表面平面横跨横断的 across。"},
                {"en": "Use along whenever motion follows the continuous contour of a linear landmark.", "cn": "凡是当位移动作紧密跟随着河流、堤岸、马路等线状地理参照物的走向顺延延伸时，毫不犹豫选用 along。"},
